<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Web Dukun Online</title>

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Poppins;
}

body{

height:100vh;

display:flex;

justify-content:center;

align-items:center;

flex-direction:column;

background:
linear-gradient(
rgba(0,0,0,0.8),
rgba(0,0,0,0.8)
),

url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518562180175-34a163b1a9a6?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop');

background-size:cover;

background-position:center;

color:white;
}

h1{

font-size:65px;

color:#d4af37;

margin-bottom:20px;

text-shadow:
0 0 20px rgba(212,175,55,0.5);
}

p{

font-size:20px;

margin-bottom:30px;

color:#ddd;
}

.menu{

display:flex;

gap:20px;
}

a{

padding:15px 28px;

border-radius:15px;

text-decoration:none;

font-weight:bold;

color:white;

transition:0.3s;
}

.services{

background:
linear-gradient(
135deg,
#9333ea,
#6b21a8
);

}

.testi{

background:
linear-gradient(
135deg,
#d4af37,
#8b5e00
);

}

.admin{

background:
linear-gradient(
135deg,
#ef4444,
#991b1b
);

}

a:hover{

transform:scale(1.08);

}

</style>

</head>
<body>

<h1>
🔮 Web Dukun Online
</h1>

<p>

Temukan ritual terbaik untuk hidupmu.

</p>

<div class="menu">

<a
href="/services"
class="services">

Lihat Ritual

</a>

<a
href="/testimonial"
class="testi">

Testimoni

</a>

<a
href="/admin/login"
class="admin">

Admin

</a>

</div>

</body>
</html>